  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Bring a medium saucepan of salted water to the boil.\n• Cut carrot into bite-sized chunks. Thinly slice capsicum. Slice onion into wedges. Place carrot, capsicum, onion and cherry tomatoes on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle with Nan's special seasoning and toss to coat. Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.\n• TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the veggies between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/623a8ef091689b5013142002/step-e27406f5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, roughly chop chargrilled capsicums and kalamata olives. Finely chop garlic.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/623a8ef091689b5013142002/step-27cd28d7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Cook farfalle in the boiling water until 'al dente', 11 minutes. Reserve some pasta water (1/4 cup for 2 people / 1/2 cup for 4 people), then drain pasta and return to saucepan.\n• TIP: 'Al dente' pasta is cooked through but still slightly firm in the centre.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/623a8ef091689b5013142002/step-d65f80b8.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "When roast veggies have 5 minutes remaining, heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook garlic, stirring, until fragrant, 1 minute. Add passata, garlic & herb seasoning, the butter, brown sugar and reserved pasta water and cook until slightly reduced, 2-3 minutes. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/623a8ef091689b5013142002/step-53d89f55.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To pan with the sauce, add cooked farfalle, chopped capsicum and olives and the roast veggies. Gently stir to combine and heat through.\n• Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/623a8ef091689b5013142002/step-f1399186.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide roast veggie farfalle between bowls.\n• Sprinkle with grated Parmesan cheese and flaked almonds to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/623a8ef091689b5013142002/step-a5fdfb9e.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
